SYS_GET_THREAD_UID (84): Get a thread's UID.
Arg = tid. Returns uid (0 = root). Used by SO_PEERCRED so a
unix server running as a separate process can resolve the
peer thread's effective uid without poking thread state
directly.

    sys_get_thread_uid_handler(arg: int)
